{"id":"vd-a1-the-hottest-day","level":"a1","n":32,"title":{"en":"You Should Drink Some Water","vi":"Bà nên uống chút nước"},"summary":"Căn hộ của bà Rose nóng như lò; Jada và bố khuyên bà vài điều cần làm ngay trong ngày nóng nhất năm.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-the-hottest-day","level":"a1","title":{"en":"The Hottest Day","vi":"Ngày nóng nhất"}},"scene":{"background":"home-day","props":[{"id":"water-bottle","x":800}]},"cast":{"jada":{"name":{"en":"Jada","vi":"Jada"},"look":"teengirl","x":560,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#7A4A2E","skinShade":"#643A22","top":"#F2C14E","topShade":"#D9A933"}},"dad":{"name":{"en":"Dad","vi":"Bố"},"look":"dad","x":330,"style":{"skin":"#7A4A2E","skinShade":"#643A22","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","top":"#5E9E7A","topShade":"#4B8765"}},"rose":{"name":{"en":"Grandma Rose","vi":"Bà Rose"},"look":"grandma","x":1170,"style":{"skin":"#8D5A3B","skinShade":"#74472D","outfit":"cardigan","top":"#C9A15C","topShade":"#B08A45"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"jada","en":"Grandma! It's so hot in here!","vi":"Bà ơi! Trong này nóng quá!","ipa":["ˈɡɹændmɑ","ɪts","soʊ","hɑt","ɪn","hiɹ"],"start":0.554,"end":2.854,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.522],[2,1.721],[3,1.934],[4,2.261],[5,2.403]]},{"speaker":"rose","en":"Is it? I'm OK. I'm just a little tired.","vi":"Thế à? Bà không sao. Bà chỉ hơi mệt thôi.","ipa":["ɪz","ɪt","aɪm","oʊˈkeɪ","aɪm","dʒʌst","ə","ˈlɪtəl","ˈtaɪɚd"],"start":3.644,"end":8.304,"expression":"tired","timing":[[0,3.644],[1,3.784],[2,5.055],[3,5.296],[4,6.887],[5,7.129],[6,7.399],[7,7.47],[8,7.711]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"Mom, your face is very red.","vi":"Mẹ ơi, mặt mẹ đỏ lắm.","ipa":["mɑm","jɔɹ","feɪs","ɪz","ˈvɛɹi","ɹɛd"],"start":9.094,"end":11.074,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,9.094],[1,9.677],[2,9.847],[3,10.174],[4,10.344],[5,10.671]]},{"speaker":"jada","en":"And you're wearing a sweater!","vi":"Mà bà còn đang mặc áo len nữa!","ipa":["ənd","jʊɹ","ˈwɛɹɪŋ","ə","ˈswɛtɚ"],"start":11.864,"end":13.294,"expression":"surprised","gesture":"point","timing":[[0,11.864],[1,11.965],[2,12.179],[3,12.548],[4,12.633]]},{"speaker":"rose","en":"I like this sweater.","vi":"Bà thích cái áo len này.","ipa":["aɪ","laɪk","ðɪs","ˈswɛtɚ"],"start":14.084,"end":15.114,"expression":"neutral","timing":[[0,14.084],[1,14.165],[2,14.45],[3,14.648]]},{"speaker":"jada","en":"You shouldn't wear it today, Grandma.","vi":"Hôm nay bà không nên mặc nó đâu ạ.","ipa":["ju","ˈʃʊdənt","wɛɹ","ɪt","təˈdeɪ","ˈɡɹændmɑ"],"start":15.904,"end":17.784,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,15.904],[1,15.987],[2,16.399],[3,16.655],[4,16.768],[5,17.18]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"And you should drink some water.","vi":"Mẹ cũng nên uống chút nước đi.","ipa":["ənd","ju","ʃʊd","dɹɪŋk","sʌm","ˈwɔtɚ"],"start":18.574,"end":20.194,"gesture":"explain","prop":"water-bottle","timing":[[0,18.574],[1,18.698],[2,18.869],[3,19.138],[4,19.479],[5,19.735]]},{"speaker":"rose","en":"But I'm not thirsty.","vi":"Nhưng mẹ có khát đâu.","ipa":["bʌt","aɪm","nɑt","ˈθɝsti"],"start":20.984,"end":22.054,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,20.984],[1,21.071],[2,21.199],[3,21.455]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"Old people often don't feel thirsty. But you need water.","vi":"Người già hay không thấy khát. Nhưng mẹ vẫn cần nước.","ipa":["oʊld","ˈpipəl","ˈɔfən","doʊnt","fil","ˈθɝsti","bʌt","ju","nid","ˈwɔtɚ"],"start":22.844,"end":27.294,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,22.844],[1,23.116],[2,23.528],[3,23.897],[4,24.167],[5,24.451],[6,26.049],[7,26.319],[8,26.518],[9,26.816]]},{"speaker":"rose","en":"OK, OK. You're right.","vi":"Được rồi, được rồi. Con nói đúng.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","oʊˈkeɪ","jʊɹ","ɹaɪt"],"start":28.084,"end":31.114,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,28.084],[1,28.768],[2,30.394],[3,30.692]]},{"speaker":"jada","en":"Why don't you come to the library with us?","vi":"Sao bà không đến thư viện với bọn cháu ạ?","ipa":["waɪ","doʊnt","ju","kʌm","tu","ðə","ˈlaɪbɹɛˌɹi","wɪð","ʌs"],"start":31.904,"end":34.194,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,31.904],[1,32.015],[2,32.229],[3,32.342],[4,32.612],[5,32.768],[6,32.925],[7,33.564],[8,33.819]]},{"speaker":"rose","en":"The library? Why?","vi":"Thư viện á? Để làm gì?","ipa":["ðə","ˈlaɪbɹɛˌɹi","waɪ"],"start":34.984,"end":37.334,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,34.984],[1,35.051],[2,36.791]]},{"speaker":"jada","en":"It's cool there. You should read the newspaper with me.","vi":"Ở đó mát lắm. Bà nên đọc báo cùng cháu.","ipa":["ɪts","kul","ðɛɹ","ju","ʃʊd","ɹid","ðə","ˈnuzˌpeɪpɚ","wɪð","mi"],"start":38.124,"end":41.394,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,38.124],[1,38.173],[2,38.471],[3,39.338],[4,39.451],[5,39.735],[6,39.963],[7,40.062],[8,40.787],[9,41.042]]},{"speaker":"rose","en":"A cool library and my granddaughter? That sounds good.","vi":"Thư viện mát mẻ lại có cháu gái đi cùng à? Nghe hay đấy.","ipa":["ə","kul","ˈlaɪbɹɛˌɹi","ənd","maɪ","ˈɡɹænˌdɔtɚ","ðæt","saʊndz","ɡʊd"],"start":42.184,"end":46.344,"expression":"happy","react":{"jada":"happy","dad":"happy"},"timing":[[0,42.184],[1,42.247],[2,42.659],[3,43.27],[4,43.383],[5,43.54],[6,45.294],[7,45.578],[8,45.947]]}],"words":[{"id":"hot","en":"hot","ipa":"hɑt","vi":"nóng; cay; hấp dẫn","level":0},{"id":"drink","en":"drink","ipa":"dɹɪŋk","vi":"uống; đồ uống","level":0},{"id":"water","en":"water","ipa":"ˈwɔtɚ","vi":"nước; tưới nước","level":0},{"id":"should","en":"should","ipa":"ʃʊd","vi":"nên; phải","level":0},{"id":"library","en":"library","ipa":"ˈlaɪbɹɛˌɹi","vi":"thư viện","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Khuyên nhủ với \"should / shouldn't\"","pattern":"You should + động từ… · You shouldn't + động từ… · Why don't you…?","explain":"\"Should + động từ\" là lời khuyên nên làm; \"shouldn't\" là không nên. Khuyên nhẹ nhàng hơn có thể nói \"Why don't you…?\". Đáp lại: \"OK, you're right.\" hoặc \"I'm OK, really.\"","keys":["you should","you shouldn't","why don't you"],"lines":[5,6,10,12]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a1-the-hottest-day.mp3","v":"78b3bbd186","duration":47.448,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}